<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Burr-Brown cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Burr-Brown cut to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co said it downgraded Burr-Brown Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Said &quot;stock has had a huge move over the last 12 months.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Remains optimistic on company's outlook and product momentum.</p>
<p>-- Short-term, &quot;it might prudent to take some profits.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Burr-Brown lost 1/4 to 30-3/4.</p>
</text>
